{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>觀塘成業街成業工業大廈一個疑闢作養殖場的單位，昨日（29日）揭發有大批爬蟲類動物斃命。警方列虐畜案，交由觀塘警區重案組接手跟進。警方今日（30日）表示，經調查後，昨日已於觀塘區拘捕一名24歲本地男子，他涉嫌「殘酷對待動物」，已獲保釋候查，須於11月下旬向警方報到。</p><figure><img alt=\"觀塘工廈單位內揭發有大批爬蟲類動物屍體。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192789747110514688358640.jpeg/mEkouHJ0kU28EXvK0mdSRCQbrhG7CliwMwBLSzMAS0s\"/><figcaption>觀塘工廈單位內揭發有大批爬蟲類動物屍體。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>愛協早前回覆稱，於單位內發現1隻奄奄一息的鬣蜥，23隻龜屍骸、7隻鬣蜥屍骸、2條魚屍骸。大部分屍體已經嚴重腐化，現場環境未有發現水糧，估計大部分動物因缺乏長時間照顧而慢慢死亡，過程承受其極大痛苦。</p><p>奄奄一息的鬣蜥，被送到嘉道理農場接受詳細檢查及治療；另32隻動物屍體則送到愛協青衣中心暫存，稍後送到漁護署解剖以了解死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"愛協昨日（29日）在場協助處理。（愛協提供圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192788348796669952940823.jpeg/OXHjprsvKoG9FQ7e2FHhwChmsL0pEPahCQ5v3wkOb98\"/><figcaption>愛協昨日（29日）在場協助處理。（愛協提供圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單位內有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192445812253134848053187.jpeg/gi7L-DNV2CLJyYbD5y7zx0Tbq5dC8caq7EL8z-xC_M8\"/><figcaption>單位內有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192456774901305344705362.jpeg/NapdPKsS960WrhqjjzBXvqrc1uy6CF4xC4uAmCGLgJg\"/><figcaption>現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是成業工業大廈一個單位。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444112461107200703916.jpeg/0wUrCbV70QEjCEHH4RAbnY2yI3JhOBLFVoIOs1aCDrM\"/><figcaption>現場是成業工業大廈一個單位。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"昨日事發後，愛護動物協會人員到場了解。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192450361453973504659732.jpeg/xx7Li69i8iR9Q6uJFq_mapL33yA-6JCgLkNDbQRDQ20\"/><figcaption>昨日事發後，愛護動物協會人員到場了解。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在單位內調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444454032642048387651.jpeg/2T52Y8VlnKH204ugWe_wGZenXWgZKIvsihUB7IoVAew\"/><figcaption>警員在單位內調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444459372253184780421.jpeg/aMzVYZFAZWXKdGWgw30YHvqJGZnbxpm6COrD6Ajqw-g\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444456675184640801794.jpeg/xLwQlDOaZJe2t3vQMKC81Yvmzk5bx_2cMN9s8DDfbPA\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女業主收樓時揭發事件。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444462119653376219837.jpeg/X1V2xCHBpfwBP-o9I2wxTlSI2kIAlIfMeGt2T3hrdk8\"/><figcaption>女業主收樓時揭發事件。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192457034876850176312460.jpeg/EPKzEqcCt-ujltB19LFtj1o5mVrx4FWREVa6cjtWunI\"/><figcaption>現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192457037280317440785012.jpeg/_UsaE_mpcEOCbz4c4Z7t-QEs8z_VxjovYjufvEg7n7w\"/><figcaption>現場有多個缸。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192444464892219392254169.jpeg/T-JPZ8dKcACakaygWWv1MPMNhZ1WirGDRPPWFUTz1hU\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:53.262806+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":531,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:11:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:24:04.608174+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:40.610236+00:00","content_hash":"3ed84ea413e980144b0beef9a5d6a2535c026b492f75fc940148fc60f402c627","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}